From feba90cae99fa5bf0e581a4fbe041ad547248529 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Ramesh Goswami <ramesh@listenfirstmedia.com>
Date: Wed, 7 Oct 2026 07:13:28 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] IMDb-Enriched TV Series Snapshot: count episodes in the
 latest season, not the whole series

Total Episodes (series-wide, e.g. Chicago Fire 299) is replaced by
Latest Season Episodes (e.g. Chicago Fire S15 = 5). Uses the season the
Metacritic row links to when available, else the highest season with
episodes (skips Specials and announced-but-empty seasons). Applied to the
TMDB path (live on Render), the OMDb fallback, and the local IMDb index path.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01GGsq2H4djYpNqUz4avVdNQ
